<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Crimson Arachna Cult -->
  <ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.label>深红蜘蛛教团</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.label>
  <!-- EN: The ancient and dangerous cult of Obsidia, worshiping Arachnas as deities, was completely exterminated many centuries ago... But Crimson Arachna Cult survived, the surviving followers hid in the dark depths and shadows of the streets, step by step putting down the roots of their influence on Obsidia and its colonies. Having absorbed enough influence, power and technology, the cult again revealed itself to the world in order to exterminate all the infidels!\n\nThe cult completely rejects any relationship, other than hostility, with other factions. -->
  <ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.description>古老的危险教团黑曜石，将蜘蛛奉为神明，几个世纪前被完全消灭了...但是深红蜘蛛教团幸存下来，幸存的追随者隐藏在街道的黑暗深处和阴影中，逐步在黑曜石及其殖民地上扎根影响。在吸收了足够的影响力、权力和技术后，该教团再次向世界展示自己，以消灭所有异教徒！\n\n该教团完全拒绝与其它派系建立除敌对外的任何关系。</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.description>
  <!-- EN: Crimson Arachna Cult -->
  <ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.fixedName>深红蜘蛛教团</ObsidiaCrimsonArachnaCult.fixedName>
